%% Context: Emergency department triage from arrival through safe disposition.
flowchart TD
  A([Patient arrives]) --> B[Register and assess vital signs]
  B --> C{Immediate life threat?}
  C -->|Yes| D[[Resuscitation bay]]
  D --> E[Stabilise and investigate]
  E --> F{Requires admission?}
  C -->|No| G{High-acuity symptoms?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Urgent clinician assessment]
  H --> I[Tests and treatment]
  I --> F
  G -->|No| J[Standard assessment queue]
  J --> K{Safe for minor-treatment stream?}
  K -->|Yes| L[Minor treatment]
  K -->|No| H
  L --> M{Discharge criteria met?}
  F -->|Yes| N([Admit or transfer])
  F -->|No| M
  M -->|Yes| O([Discharge with advice])
  M -->|No| P[Observe and reassess]
  P -.-> I
